  "description": "A lightweight ASP.NET Core middleware for generating realistic mock API responses using local LLMs (via Ollama). Supports REST, GraphQL, SSE streaming, SignalR real-time data, gRPC, and OpenAPI specs. NEW in v2.2: Pluggable tools & actions with MCP-compatible architecture, pre-configured REST APIs, dynamic context memory with auto-expiration, and enhanced thread-safety. Perfect for prototyping, demos, and testing. Compatible with .NET 8.0 and later.",
